The plate is a square side plate, roughly 24 cm across. The tuna salad mound covers about 90 x 100 px of the plate's roughly 400 px width, which is about 6 cm x 6.5 cm. At a height of about 3 cm, that is roughly 100-120 g.

The salad looks like tuna with celery, red onion and mayonnaise. Tuna salad with mayo runs about 190 kcal/100 g. The carrot shreds on the side plate are not on this plate, so I left them out. There are only a few carrot shreds on top of the salad, which is a negligible amount.

